            <title>[LUDOC-579] Add the LNet per-operation latency statistics to LOM</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LUDOC-579</link>
                <project id="10070" key="LUDOC">Lustre Documentation</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-20426" title="add per-operation lnet latency stats" class="issue-link" data-issue-key="LU-20426"&gt;&lt;del&gt;LU-20426&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; added per-operation latency statistics to LNet. The put_egress, get_rtt and put_ack keys show the latency of each operation type. The "lnetctl set latency_stats" command and the lnet_latency_stats_enabled module parameter control the capture. The Lustre Operations Manual must document the statistics, the command and the parameter.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
